    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d514">

                <pb facs="0696" n="588" sameAs="frus:frus1891/pg588"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Wharton to Sir
                            Julian Pauncefote</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1891-08-22"><hi rendition="#italic">August 22,
                        1891</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to my note to you of the 23d
                    ultimo, relative to the proposed agreement of arbitration of certain matters
                    affecting the seal fisheries in Behring Sea, I would be extremely obliged if you
                    would be kind enough to inform me when an answer to the same may be
                    expected.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">William F. Wharton</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
